{"subject_id": "9018411", "chunk_id": "0d8d37816fbf", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "题材基本面介绍", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 33, "source": "strict_knowledge", "created_at": "2026-03-13T11:31:44", "source_id": "detail_9018411_0", "order": 0, "used_fallback": false, "title": "题材基本面介绍", "text": "光刻胶：半导体晶圆制造核心材料\n光刻胶是一种在特定光源照射下发生局部溶解度变化的光敏材料，在集成电路制造中主要用于光刻环节。", "uid": "9416730989cb"}
{"subject_id": "9018411", "chunk_id": "ffec9af217ba", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "题材基本面介绍", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 34, "source": "strict_knowledge", "created_at": "2026-03-13T11:31:44", "source_id": "detail_9018411_0", "order": 1, "used_fallback": false, "title": "题材基本面介绍", "text": "光刻胶是半导体制造关键材料。光刻是精细线路图形加工中最重要的工艺，决定着芯片的最小特征尺寸。", "uid": "051e6d5efdb1"}
{"subject_id": "9018411", "chunk_id": "bf5a2003d266", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "题材基本面介绍", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 35, "text": "[IMAGE]", "source": "knowledge_image_placeholder", "created_at": "2026-03-13T11:31:44", "source_id": "detail_9018411_0", "order": 2, "used_fallback": true, "uid": "343dcc18eb36"}
{"subject_id": "9018411", "chunk_id": "043f235881d0", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "题材基本面介绍", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 36, "source": "strict_knowledge", "created_at": "2026-03-13T11:31:44", "source_id": "detail_9018411_0", "order": 3, "used_fallback": false, "title": "题材基本面介绍", "text": "根据曝光波长的不同，目前市场上应用较多的光刻胶可分为G线、I线、KrF、ArF和EUV5种类型。光刻胶波长越短，加工分辨率越高。", "uid": "c254a2b64447"}
{"subject_id": "9018411", "chunk_id": "b008cdec2297", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "题材基本面介绍", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 38, "source": "strict_knowledge", "created_at": "2026-03-13T11:31:44", "source_id": "detail_9018411_0", "order": 5, "used_fallback": false, "title": "题材基本面介绍", "text": "光刻胶产业链上游为原树脂、单体、感光剂、溶剂等光刻胶原材料；中游为基于配方的光刻胶生产合成，下游主要为各芯片应用环节。由于光刻胶本身就是一种配方型的经验学科，又高度影响光刻环节的精度和良率，因此在光刻胶产业链的三个环节都存在较高壁垒。", "uid": "02ac2670fa16"}
